==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|skrifa|lang=non}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{m|gem-pro|*skrībaną}}, a late borrowing from {{etyl|la|is}} {{term|scrībō||write|lang=la}}, ultimately from {{etyl|ine-pro|is}} {{m|ine-pro|*skreybʰ-}}. Compare Faroese {{term|skriva|lang=fo}}, Norwegian and Danish {{term|skrive|lang=da}}, Swedish {{term|skriva|lang=sv}}, West Frisian {{term|skriuwe|lang=fy}}, Low German {{term|schrieven|lang=nds}}, Dutch {{term|schrijven|lang=nl}}, German {{term|schreiben|lang=de}}.

===Pronunciation===
